## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Guidance memorials inherit the full `:mm/Memory` slot vocabulary plus class-specific extensions:

- **at-startup metadata** — `at-startup`, `one-line` (tiering for the at-startup-visibility surface)
- **captureability metadata** — `mid-conversation-captureable`, `inject-trigger`, `inject-class`, `audit-class` (state-change-detection fields)
- **cross-memorial relations** — `contradicts` (anti-pattern → guidance), `demonstrates` (pattern ← example)

